## t2 - Every test must be able to fail for the reason its name gives

Test 4 (`every_custom_attribute_is_namespaced_and_never_uses_the_reserved_otel_prefix`) has an incomplete assertion. It filters to attributes starting with `"kaibo."` then asserts each starts with `"kaibo."` or `"process."` — a tautology given the filter. More critically, the test name claims to check **every** custom attribute, but only examines `kaibo.` ones; if the code generated non-namespaced custom attributes with a different prefix, the test would still pass.

Test 2 (`from_query_sets_kaibo_outcome_to_gap_for_a_default_hit_census`) names the function being tested (`from_query`), making it an implementation detail; if that function were renamed, the test name would be inaccurate—but this is a t3 violation, not t2.

